      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T17:29:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "- on pixel devices, the hal will take a wakelock for a short duration after a packet is received from a remote device; do you have the same logic on TV ? This would ensure a platform wakeup when the GATT response is received\n\n- what is causing the ACL disconnection in this case ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 8
      },
      "revId": "a77aa3e15f6dcb3aee47af233f554f56821c6290",
