        "id": 1884477
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T20:29:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is preventing the controller from waking up the soc ? This issue would likely affect many other areas / profiles in the stack. If that were the case then this patch you are proposing would be very limited compared to the scale of the issue.",
      "parentUuid": "56e38c3b_1476d5e6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 8
      },
      "revId": "a77aa3e15f6dcb3aee47af233f554f56821c6290",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b894438_85f3e7ae",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
