      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T20:43:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s quite common among TVs to not have this facility. I agree that if we don\u0027t want any unintended fallout on other platforms we can put this behind a flag/config and only flip it on where it\u0027s needed.",
      "parentUuid": "1354db6c_4ebbba1b",
